{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19165","headline":"答乐天所寄咏怀且释其枯树之叹 · 刘禹锡","name":"答乐天所寄咏怀且释其枯树之叹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"衙前有乐馔常精，宅内连池酒任倾。\n自是官高无狎客，不论年长少欢情。\n骊龙颔被探珠去，老蚌胚还应月生。\n莫羡三春桃与李，桂花成实向秋荣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19165.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19165","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}